{"name":"Sundress","hex":"#ebcf89","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"sundress","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A typically sleeveless dress, usually a minidress, made of light, loose-fitting material for spring and summer wear."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/sundress"}],"entries":[{"title":"Sundress","blocks":[{"text":"A sundress or summer dress is an informal or casual dress intended to be worn in warm weather, typically in a lightweight fabric, most commonly cotton, and usually loose-fitting. It is commonly a bodice-style sleeveless dress, typically with a wide neckline and thin shoulder straps, and may be backless. A sundress is typically worn without a layering top and is not usually worn over a blouse, sweater, or t-shirt, or with leggings."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7d/A_Woman_in_a_Red_Sundress.jpg/330px-A_Woman_in_a_Red_Sundress.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sundress"},{"title":"Sundress (song)","blocks":[{"text":"\"Sundress\" is a song by American rapper ASAP Rocky, released as a single on November 20, 2018. It was co-produced by Danger Mouse, and samples the 2010 Tame Impala song \"Why Won't You Make Up Your Mind?\" Its accompanying music video was released the same day."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/e/e5/ASAP_Rocky_%E2%80%93_Sundress.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sundress_(song)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/86/Sun_dress.tif/lossy-page1-500px-Sun_dress.tif.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/86/Sun_dress.tif/lossy-page1-1280px-Sun_dress.tif.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://